---
// Three ways in
---
<!-- =====================================================================
     THREE WAYS IN
     ===================================================================== -->
<section id="ways" class="shell band-sm scroll-mt-20">
  <div class="grid gap-5 md:grid-cols-3">

    <article class="bg-mint-tint hook-s-tr hook-s-bl rounded-xl p-[clamp(22px,2.2vw,32px)] flex flex-col gap-4 reveal">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
        <svg class="w-[24px] h-[24px] text-teal shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><use href="#i-users"/></svg>
        <span class="text-[10.5px] font-extrabold tracking-[0.16em] text-on-mint-tint">01</span>
      </div>
      <h3 class="heading text-[clamp(21px,2vw,28px)]">Member</h3>
      <p class="text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-body">
        For Ghanaian professionals, founders and researchers. Access to training,
        the talent pool, incubation support and the practitioner network.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-auto pt-4 border-t border-[#BFD9CE]">
        <p class="text-[10px] font-extrabold tracking-[0.16em] text-on-mint-tint mb-1.5">YOU PROVIDE</p>
        <p class="text-[13px] leading-[1.55] text-ink">A short profile and your area of practice.</p>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="bg-gold-tint hook-s-tr hook-s-bl rounded-xl p-[clamp(22px,2.2vw,32px)] flex flex-col gap-4 reveal" style="--d:90ms">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
        <svg class="w-[24px] h-[24px] text-on-gold-tint shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><use href="#i-handshake"/></svg>
        <span class="text-[10.5px] font-extrabold tracking-[0.16em] text-on-gold-tint">02</span>
      </div>
      <h3 class="heading text-[clamp(21px,2vw,28px)]">Project partner</h3>
      <p class="text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-body">
        For European and Ghanaian organisations with work to place: use cases,
        training mandates, governance advisory or R&amp;D collaborations.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-auto pt-4 border-t border-[#DFC98F]">
        <p class="text-[10px] font-extrabold tracking-[0.16em] text-on-gold-tint mb-1.5">YOU PROVIDE</p>
        <p class="text-[13px] leading-[1.55] text-ink">The service areas you are interested in.</p>
      </div>
    </article>

    <article class="bg-coral-tint hook-s-tr hook-s-bl rounded-xl p-[clamp(22px,2.2vw,32px)] flex flex-col gap-4 reveal" style="--d:180ms">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-4">
        <svg class="w-[24px] h-[24px] text-on-coral-tint shrink-0" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.9" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><use href="#i-landmark"/></svg>
        <span class="text-[10.5px] font-extrabold tracking-[0.16em] text-on-coral-tint">03</span>
      </div>
      <h3 class="heading text-[clamp(21px,2vw,28px)]">Supporter</h3>
      <p class="text-[13.5px] leading-[1.6] text-body">
        For institutions, foundations and chambers backing the corridor:
        sponsorship, co-funded programmes, facilities or academic collaboration.
      </p>
      <div class="mt-auto pt-4 border-t border-[#E0B0A8]">
        <p class="text-[10px] font-extrabold tracking-[0.16em] text-on-coral-tint mb-1.5">YOU PROVIDE</p>
        <p class="text-[13px] leading-[1.55] text-ink">The form of support you are considering.</p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>
